# Recipe of the Play 6 projector app, read by tools/devices/assemble_app.py.
# The shared files of apps/common/projector (its FILES list), the HIDL transport and the 1.0.8 import (the items
# hal and migrate of apps/common/sync.sh), then the Play 6 layer. Since setup step 4 apps/Play6Projector is only the
# Play 6 layer (its own files and its forks of Z9X files, each with a row in tools/play6/forks.tsv); the shared
# files come from apps/common and are never copied into it. tools/play6/build_play6.sh builds the assembled tree.
app       Play6Projector
base      apps/common/projector apps/common/projector/FILES
file      apps/common/hal/HidlCaller.java src/org/lumen/projector/hal/HidlCaller.java
file      apps/common/LumenImport.java src/org/lumen/common/LumenImport.java
# the settings look of Lumen OS 1.0.9 from the Z9X app itself (Kit, Shell, fonts, icons, strings_settings2)
base      apps/Z9xProjector devices/dragon_healthy/app/Play6Projector.settings2
# the shared projector menu of every Lumen projector with the Play 6 profile; the
# Play 6 adapter is apps/Play6Projector panel/Play6Features (+ Play6MenuGates, Play6MenuPages, Play6Menu)
module    lumen-menu
file      devices/dragon_healthy/menu.json assets/lumen_menu/menu.json
top       apps/Play6Projector
skip      build/ *.apk CHANGES*.md README*.md SYNCED.txt .DS_Store
# a byte-identical copy of a shared file in apps/Play6Projector is red: delete it, the common layer gives it
identical error
